{"ref":"BDB, יָנַק","hw":"יָנַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יָנַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> suck <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">יְנַק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܝܺܢܰܩ</span>, and deriv.; Assyrian <em>enîḳu</em>, <em>suck</em> SASm <sup>Asrb. i, Gloss.</sup> <em>mušêniḳtu</em>, <em>nurse</em>, Jen <sup>ZA, 1886, 402</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיָנַקְתְּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.16\">Is 60:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִינַקְתֶּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.12\">66:12</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִינָ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:16\" href=\"/Job.20.16\">Jb 20:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִינָ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:12\" href=\"/Job.3.12\">3:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּינָ֑קִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.16\">Is 60:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִינָ֑קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.19\">Dt 33:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּינְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.11\">Is 66:11</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.25\">Dt 32:25</a> + 7 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹנֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:12\" href=\"/Numbers.11.12\">Nu 11:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנְקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:3\" href=\"/Psalms.8.3\">ψ 8:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנְקֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:16\" href=\"/Joel.2.16\">Jo 2:16</a>;—<em>suck</em>, of infant at mother’s breast, abs. <a data-ref=\"Job 3:12\" href=\"/Job.3.12\">Jb 3:12</a>; metaph. of abundance and honour of Jerusalem in future, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.11\">Is 66:11</a> abs.; sq. acc. of breast <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.16\">60:16</a>, acc. of milk v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.12\">66:12</a>;